export const html = "<h1 id=\"chapter-6--meme-studio\">Chapter 6 · Meme Studio</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How you actually turn a fact into a meme — with your own photo or an\n<a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/glossary.md#ai-image-meme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">AI-generated image</a> — and what's true about each\npath underneath.</p>\n<p>Deep spec: <a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/meme-and-video-studio.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\"><code>meme-and-video-studio.md</code></a>.\nRelated: <a href=\"/admin/help/5-visual-pipeline\" data-help-internal=\"/admin/help/5-visual-pipeline\"><code>5-visual-pipeline.md</code></a> (the shared machinery\nbehind AI image generation), <a href=\"/admin/help/10-payments-and-membership\" data-help-internal=\"/admin/help/10-payments-and-membership\"><code>10-payments-and-membership.md</code></a>\n(what <a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/glossary.md#legendary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">Legendary</a> unlocks).</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"what-it-does\">What it does</h2>\n<p>Once you've found a fact you want to make into a meme, the <a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/glossary.md#studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">studio</a> is where\nyou actually build it. You can build a meme from your own photo, a stock\nor <a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/glossary.md#template\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">template</a> background, or — if you're Legendary — an AI-generated image\nbuilt around your own likeness. Whichever\n<a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/glossary.md#background\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">background</a> you choose, the studio composes it with the fact's text and\nsaves it as your meme.</p>\n<h2 id=\"how-it-works\">How it works</h2>\n<h3 id=\"two-ways-to-build-a-background\">Two ways to build a background</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Your own photo or a built-in background.</strong> Upload a photo, or pick a\n<a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/glossary.md#stock-image\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">stock image</a> or one of the built-in templates. This is available to\nanyone signed in — no paid plan required.</li>\n<li><strong>An AI-generated image.</strong> Legendary members can style a source photo\ninto the fact's scene. Every AI image starts from a photo of yours; there\nis no generating from a description alone, and no shared per-fact gallery\nof AI images to pick from (that picker went with the older studio).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>There are no video memes: video was deleted before launch, to be rebuilt\nlater (<a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/decisions.md#2026-10-05--launch-scope-video-deferred-the-share-loop-and-open-graph-previews-launch-critical-and-the-rest-of-the-feature-walk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">decisions</a>; the record is in\n<a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/retired/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\"><code>docs/retired/</code></a>).</p>\n<p>You build memes in one of two places. On a fact's page, the builder opens\nstraight onto the image you'll make. On a shared meme's page, \"make this about me\" opens a\nsingle-screen builder that remakes that meme for you, and Legendary members\ncan style their own photo into it there too. An older studio that used to\nsit behind the fact page was deleted before launch\n(<a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/decisions.md#2026-10-22--the-legacy-meme-studio-is-deleted-the-user-generate-route-survives-photo-only-until-pulid-goes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">decisions</a>).</p>\n<h3 id=\"what-actually-gets-saved\">What actually gets saved</h3>\n<p>A meme you build from your own photo, a stock image, or a template isn't\nstored as a finished picture — it's saved as a <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/glossary.md#recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">recipe</a></strong>: which\nbackground you chose and what text goes with it. The actual image is\ncomposed fresh every time someone views it, not generated once and stored.\nAn AI-generated image, by contrast, <em>is</em> a real file, since\ngenerating it is the expensive part — the meme recipe just points at that\nalready-generated file.</p>\n<p>An AI-generated image is tied to the meme you made with it. That's a\nstorage fact, not a privacy one: like any other meme, it's public unless you\nturn the privacy option on yourself.</p>\n<h3 id=\"where-your-media-lives\">Where your media lives</h3>\n<p>Anything that's a real file — a photo you uploaded or an AI-generated\nimage — is stored the same way any other user content on\nOverhype.me is stored. A meme built from a stock photo or template stores\nno image of its own at all, just the recipe pointing back at the\nalready-existing stock photo or template.</p>\n<h2 id=\"why-it-works-this-way\">Why it works this way</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Saving a recipe instead of a picture keeps a template-based meme\ncurrent.</strong> If Overhype.me improves how memes are composed — better text\nplacement, a rendering fix — a recipe-based meme picks that improvement\nup automatically the next time anyone views it, instead of being frozen\nat whatever quality existed the moment it was made.</li>\n<li><strong>AI generation costs real money per use, so it's the Legendary\nperk.</strong> Building from your own photo or a stock/template background\ncosts Overhype.me nothing extra per meme, so it stays open to everyone\nsigned in. Generating a new AI image does cost something every\ntime, which is why that's the part gated to a paid membership rather\nthan the studio as a whole.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"boundaries--known-limitations\">Boundaries &#x26; known limitations</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Uploading your own photo to build a meme isn't currently paywalled</strong>,\neven though the product has machinery elsewhere that suggests it might\nonce have been intended to be. <strong>Needs David confirmation</strong> on whether\nthat's the intended, permanent behavior.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"going-deeper\">Going deeper</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Spec: <a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/meme-and-video-studio.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\"><code>meme-and-video-studio.md</code></a>\n— the exact routes, the recipe/<code>imageSource</code> shape, tier-gate specifics,\nand the storage layout.</li>\n<li>Related: <a href=\"/admin/help/5-visual-pipeline\" data-help-internal=\"/admin/help/5-visual-pipeline\"><code>5-visual-pipeline.md</code></a> (the shared image\nmachinery), <a href=\"/admin/help/10-payments-and-membership\" data-help-internal=\"/admin/help/10-payments-and-membership\"><code>10-payments-and-membership.md</code></a>\n(what Legendary unlocks generally).</li>\n<li>Rationale: the studio/media entries in <a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/decisions.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\"><code>decisions.md</code></a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Next:</strong> chapter 7 — <a href=\"/admin/help/7-public-site-and-sharing\" data-help-internal=\"/admin/help/7-public-site-and-sharing\"><code>7-public-site-and-sharing.md</code></a>,\nhome, search, <a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/glossary.md#hashtags\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">hashtags</a>, leaderboard,\nprofiles, OG cards, and <a href=\"https://github.com/TheAnswerManIsHere/Overhypeme/blob/main/docs/ai-context/glossary.md#merch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external=\"true\">merch</a> — the surfaces\nthe loop closes through.</p>\n<p><em>Verified against <code>e9669d2</code> (2026-08-09) · claim inventory in PR #371.</em></p>";
